#### PHASE 4: Optional Enhancement to `view-file.vue`

**Goal**: Add a `previewMode` prop that, when true, shows actual values instead of example text and disables editing.

This is an optional enhancement. The `mapping-preview.vue` component can implement its own canvas-based PDF rendering (like the existing preview dialog in `view-file.vue`), which is the recommended approach to avoid coupling. The preview code in `view-file.vue` (lines 395-469) is already a good pattern to follow -- it renders a page with canvas and overlays field divs with positioned text.

If the team prefers to reuse `view-file.vue`, add:
